<title>DUBAI: Abu Dhabi's ADNOC cuts November crude prices.</title>
<headline>Abu Dhabi's ADNOC cuts November crude prices.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abu Dhabi National Oil Co (ADNOC) has cut the price of its crudes lifted in November by between $0.70 and $0.75 per barrel, the company said on Sunday.</p>
<p>Murban, Lower Zakum and Umm Shaif are all dropped $0.70 a barrel to $23.10, $23.15 and $22.85 respectively.</p>
<p>Upper Zakum is cut $0.75 a barrel to $21.20.</p>
</text>
